# triage-workspace .gitignore — allowlist strategy
#
# `/*` is non-recursive: it ignores everything at the workspace root, then
# individual entries below un-ignore the files the workspace itself tracks.
# This means:
#   - Every checked-out child repo (triage/, triage-action/, ...) is ignored.
#   - Every git worktree sibling (triage-foo/, triage-bar/, ...) is ignored
#     automatically — no maintenance needed as branches come and go.
#   - Every other local artifact (.DS_Store, .scratch/, ...) is ignored
#     without being listed explicitly.
#
# If you add a new tracked file or directory at the workspace root, add a
# corresponding `!/name` line below.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Makefile
!/Makefile.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/repos.mk
!/triage.code-workspace
!/.cursor/
